          "id": "p3-12",
          "speaker": "Thomas",
          "text": "Well, I went out to Kenya for a couple of weeks to train …"
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-13",
          "speaker": "Jeanne",
          "text": "Really! I didn’t know that."
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-14",
          "speaker": "Thomas",
          "text": "I was chosen to go there out of loads of kids and run with some of the top teenage athletes in the world. And … I was so calm about it. I just kept thinking how fortunate I was. What a great chance this was! Everyone back home was so proud of me. But once we started competing, I very quickly realised I wasn’t good enough."
